 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi! How are you today?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.34,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_02"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Doing well, thank you.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.5,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "My kids are really upset about moving to a new town.",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 0.54,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "moving_house.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's understandable, it's a big change. How old are they?",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 0.91,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "moving_house.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Six and eleven.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.79,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "moving_house.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Letting them have some say helps a lot. The younger one could choose a paint colour for their room, the older one could help plan the layout.",
   "est_sec": 8.47,
   "gap_before": 0.99,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "moving_house.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "My eleven year old is mostly sad about",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 2.39,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "moving_house.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "leaving her best friend.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.74,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "moving_house.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's the hardest part. Plan a visit or a sleepover in the first couple of months, so she knows the friendship doesn't have to end.",
   "est_sec": 7.85,
   "gap_before": 0.5,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "moving_house.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "That's a good idea. They could video call too.",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 0.43,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "moving_house.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Exactly. And finding a club in the new town quickly will help her meet people her age.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 1.31,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "moving_house.dlg3"
  }
 ]
}
